			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "概述"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20260920122941-iwjp5y3",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20260920122941-iwjp5y3",
				"updated": "20260920122941"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "智能体会优先将标准明确、重复的分类、筛选和评分任务交给 TypeSafe System One（Jev）。例如，要求智能体按给定标准评价选中文档与研究问题的相关程度。智能体可以直接传递区块 ID，由内核读取完整正文，减少主模型重复输出正文的负担。无需启用嵌入或重排模型。"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20260920123707-dk1tbi0",
			"Type": "NodeHeading",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20260920123707-dk1tbi0",
				"updated": "20260920123707"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "配置方式"
				}
			],
			"HeadingLevel": 2
		},
		{
			"ID": "20260920122941-e5xvhrd",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20260920122941-e5xvhrd",
				"updated": "20260920122941"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "在 "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "设置"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " - "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "人工智能"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " - "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "决策模型"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " 中填写接口地址、API 密钥、模型名称和请求超时，测试连接后启用。默认关闭，接口地址为 https://api.typesafe.ai/v1/systemone，模型为 jev-latest，超时为 30 秒。关闭后保留配置。"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20260920123707-b3dug8y",
			"Type": "NodeHeading",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20260920123707-b3dug8y",
				"updated": "20260920123707"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "结果说明"
				}
			],
			"HeadingLevel": 2
		},
		{
			"ID": "20260920122941-qpkgek0",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20260920122941-qpkgek0",
				"updated": "20260920122941"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "主模型仍负责理解需求、复杂推理、工具选择和最终回答。评分可能介于两个等级之间，概率和置信度不代表结果一定正确。失败和未处理的项目会单独标记，已完成的结果会保留，请求不会自动重试。"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20260920123707-te89kkt",
			"Type": "NodeHeading",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20260920123707-te89kkt",
				"updated": "20260920123707"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "内容与权限"
				}
			],
			"HeadingLevel": 2
		},
		{
			"ID": "20260920122941-au1tcls",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20260920122941-au1tcls",
				"updated": "20260920122941"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "相关内容会发送到配置的决策服务，可能产生费用。工具调用沿用现有的能力确认策略。加密笔记本必须先解锁，引用其中的区块还需要提供笔记本 ID。连接测试使用固定样例，不读取笔记内容。"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20260920122941-yh1yy94",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
